> Everybody has a deficiency.

Obsessing over validation, obsessing over attention, obsessing over love. An addiction that combats a lack of something else only ends in one way.

A well crafted film that tackles addiction like no other. Phenomenal soundtrack and edited in a way that elevates the message of slowly falling into an addiction.

The greatest film I can never recommend.
